3035
02:57:30,940 --> 02:57:33,440
And I think my next objective is going to be...

3036
02:57:34,240 --> 02:57:36,440
Well, trying to get up there, of course, and see what's going on.

3037
02:57:36,840 --> 02:57:37,460
And kill those people.

3038
02:57:38,080 --> 02:57:40,400
And then also go to the ancient laboratory.

3039
02:57:41,780 --> 02:57:43,200
Or whatever that place was.

3040
02:57:44,160 --> 02:57:45,240
In the snowy place.

3041
02:57:45,860 --> 02:57:46,540
That's what I'm gonna do.

3042
02:57:50,220 --> 02:57:51,020
Return to game.

3043
02:57:53,320 --> 02:57:54,460
I can go for a bit longer.

3044
02:57:56,680 --> 02:57:57,720
Let's see what we got here.

3045
02:57:58,340 --> 02:58:00,060
That's a great start, because look at this.

3046
02:58:01,020 --> 02:58:01,900
Oh, you know what, man?

3047
02:58:02,760 --> 02:58:03,860
I'm gonna be so...

3048
02:58:04,960 --> 02:58:05,840
What do you call it?

3049
02:58:06,960 --> 02:58:08,220
It's... optimal this time.

3050
02:58:08,280 --> 02:58:09,980
I'm not actually gonna grab the health up there.

3051
02:58:11,200 --> 02:58:15,220
Just in case I find the perk that will grant me more health every time I take one of those.

3052
02:58:16,480 --> 02:58:17,740
So I'm saving that.

3053
02:58:19,180 --> 02:58:20,660
As nuts as that sounds.

3054
02:58:24,240 --> 02:58:25,260
Because I want to be...

3055
02:58:26,420 --> 02:58:27,480
The air feels heavy?

3056
02:58:28,780 --> 02:58:29,760
What the fuck does that mean?

3057
02:58:31,460 --> 02:58:32,800
The air feels heavy.

3058
02:58:34,440 --> 02:58:34,880
Wow.

3059
02:58:36,300 --> 02:58:36,600
Sir.

3060
02:58:37,620 --> 02:58:38,600
Do not do that to me.

3061
02:58:43,980 --> 02:58:44,320
There we go.

3062
02:58:44,940 --> 02:58:45,100
Boink.

3063
02:58:47,260 --> 02:58:48,100
Show me the goods.

3064
02:58:54,700 --> 02:58:55,580
What do we have up here?

3065
02:59:02,310 --> 02:59:03,870
Oh, there's a bunch of gold hanging up there.

3066
02:59:09,490 --> 02:59:09,750
Wait.

3067
02:59:11,070 --> 02:59:11,390
Toxic rock?

3068
02:59:13,070 --> 02:59:14,010
I don't like that.

3069
02:59:15,710 --> 02:59:16,530
Why is that here?

3070
02:59:17,170 --> 02:59:18,170
That scares me.

3071
02:59:21,300 --> 02:59:22,060
Me no likey.

3072
02:59:23,140 --> 02:59:23,580
The hell?

3073
02:59:27,740 --> 02:59:28,820
What is happening here?

3074
02:59:31,850 --> 02:59:35,370
I wonder if anything I do in previous runs will affect next runs.

3075
02:59:36,930 --> 02:59:38,150
I'm inclined to say no.

3076
02:59:39,950 --> 02:59:41,050
But I'm not sure.

3077
02:59:43,850 --> 02:59:44,010
Hamis!

3078
02:59:46,190 --> 02:59:46,870
It's been a while.

3079
02:59:47,210 --> 02:59:47,650
What's up, Hamis?

3080
02:59:48,830 --> 02:59:49,990
Hand over your lunch money.

3081
02:59:54,520 --> 02:59:56,320
Um, I could get through there if I want to.

3082
02:59:56,460 --> 02:59:58,500
I have nine more shots of the good stuff.

3083
03:00:06,260 --> 03:00:09,500
Man, I was like, I'm just gonna grab that and throw it, but I can't.

3084
03:00:09,580 --> 03:00:10,600
I don't have telekinesis anymore.

3085
03:00:13,420 --> 03:00:14,900
That is such a good perk.

3086
03:00:21,870 --> 03:00:22,010
Didn't.

3087
03:00:28,980 --> 03:00:30,360
Oh, dude, another thing I want to do.

3088
03:00:30,820 --> 03:00:32,840
I want to find a persistent light source.

3089
03:00:33,440 --> 03:00:34,560
And then I want to go into the dark.

3090
03:00:35,720 --> 03:00:36,280
I don't...

3091
03:00:36,280 --> 03:00:38,360
Is it here or the next stage?

3092
03:00:39,060 --> 03:00:41,860
There's a place to the west where everything is super dark.

3093
03:00:41,940 --> 03:00:43,700
And you cannot light it up by going in there.

3094
03:00:43,800 --> 03:00:44,720
You have to have a light.

3095
03:00:45,160 --> 03:00:47,840
Remember when we had the rock that lighted up?

3096
03:00:48,980 --> 03:00:49,940
That's what I'm talking about.

3097
03:00:50,440 --> 03:00:51,440
That's where I want to go as well.

3098
03:00:54,640 --> 03:00:55,280
What is that?

3099
03:00:56,520 --> 03:00:56,940
Lava potion?

3100
03:00:58,040 --> 03:00:59,700
I don't think so, buddy.

3101
03:01:07,410 --> 03:01:08,090
A bunch of gunpowder.

3102
03:01:11,130 --> 03:01:11,270
Hamis!

3103
03:01:13,110 --> 03:01:14,010
Oh, wait, that's not a hamis.

3104
03:01:14,090 --> 03:01:15,030
That's a horta.

3105
03:01:22,810 --> 03:01:25,190
And I have to remember, I'm not immune to fire anymore.

3106
03:01:25,710 --> 03:01:28,650
So let's be careful around fire.

3107
03:01:29,890 --> 03:01:31,090
In fact, I'm doing really well so far.

3108
03:01:31,670 --> 03:01:32,690
It's actually wild.

3109
03:01:33,170 --> 03:01:33,170
Why

3110
03:01:43,600 --> 03:01:46,680
did so much fucking get set on fire here?

3111
03:01:46,820 --> 03:01:47,080
What happened?

3112
03:01:50,400 --> 03:01:53,300
There was no fucking fire when I went and then it dropped on me.

3113
03:01:53,740 --> 03:01:54,580
The chance of that.

3114
03:01:57,080 --> 03:01:57,820
It's okay, though.

3115
03:01:58,040 --> 03:01:58,520
Just five HP.

3116
03:02:01,200 --> 03:02:04,640
Then again, HP is actually one of the most valuable things in this game.

3117
03:02:04,640 --> 03:02:11,780
Like, every single point of damage you take is actually significant.

3118
03:02:12,740 --> 03:02:15,140
Even in the late game, you know?

3119
03:02:16,220 --> 03:02:17,820
That shit can come back and haunt you later.

3120
03:02:19,920 --> 03:02:23,960
Could mean the difference between taking a heal in a holy mountain and not and saving it.

3121
03:02:26,180 --> 03:02:28,100
That's a big dealio, friendlio.

3122
03:02:32,270 --> 03:02:32,770
Hamis!

3123
03:02:36,470 --> 03:02:36,910
Gorta!

3124
03:02:38,390 --> 03:02:39,890
I will learn the names of all the enemies.

3125
03:02:40,090 --> 03:02:41,190
I'm kidding, I won't.

3126
03:02:42,570 --> 03:02:43,450
Wasn't that a good joke?

3127
03:02:44,530 --> 03:02:45,030
Comedy tour soon.

3128
03:02:45,890 --> 03:02:46,450
Coming up.

3129
03:02:47,510 --> 03:02:48,270
Somewhere near you.

3130
03:02:49,710 --> 03:02:50,430
Collapsed mines.

3131
03:02:56,250 --> 03:02:56,530
Okay.

3132
03:02:58,410 --> 03:02:59,690
Nothing of interest that way.

3133
03:03:05,210 --> 03:03:06,350
Haven't you found a wand yet?

3134
03:03:07,290 --> 03:03:08,010
Isn't that kind of unusual?

3135
03:03:11,070 --> 03:03:11,730
Oh, wow.

3136
03:03:12,630 --> 03:03:14,210
We charge on that, it takes a while.

3137
03:03:17,430 --> 03:03:17,590
Oh!

3138
03:03:19,610 --> 03:03:20,970
Is that a shotgun man?

3139
03:03:21,810 --> 03:03:21,990
Jesus!

3140
03:03:23,950 --> 03:03:25,170
What the hell just happened there?

3141
03:03:29,610 --> 03:03:30,650
Well, I can shoot too.

3142
03:03:31,770 --> 03:03:32,370
That's annoying.

3143
03:03:32,990 --> 03:03:34,530
Have a rain of fire there.

3144
03:03:39,640 --> 03:03:40,000
All right.

3145
03:03:42,060 --> 03:03:43,180
I think this is the portal.

3146
03:03:44,580 --> 03:03:45,540
I mean, we could go through.

3147
03:03:51,600 --> 03:03:52,040
Yo-ho!

3148
03:03:52,380 --> 03:03:52,660
That

3149
03:03:57,040 --> 03:03:59,060
was a close one.

3150
03:04:06,110 --> 03:04:07,910
There's one really scary dude in this place.

3151
03:04:09,210 --> 03:04:09,590
Somewhere.

3152
03:04:10,430 --> 03:04:10,830
What is that?

3153
03:04:11,590 --> 03:04:11,870
Pheromone.

3154
03:04:19,330 --> 03:04:20,070
Give me that.

3155
03:04:22,430 --> 03:04:22,990
Whoa!

3156
03:04:28,970 --> 03:04:29,530
Ow!

3157
03:04:30,130 --> 03:04:30,890
You motherfucker!

3158
03:04:37,010 --> 03:04:38,070
That guy has HP!

3159
03:04:41,570 --> 03:04:42,810
Yeah, let's not go down there.

3160
03:04:43,170 --> 03:04:43,870
Not worth it.

3161
03:04:54,340 --> 03:04:56,000
Speaking of preserving HP.

3162
03:04:56,940 --> 03:04:58,180
Think about it like this.

3163
03:04:58,780 --> 03:05:06,620
If I use one of those HP heals in the Holy Mountain, it will just max out my HP, right?

3164
03:05:06,740 --> 03:05:09,240
So if my max HP is 100, it will only heal 50.

3165
03:05:09,940 --> 03:05:12,700
Let's say I don't take any damage in the first area, right?

3166
03:05:13,920 --> 03:05:18,020
That is so important later on, because that heal could have been like a thousand heal.

3167
03:05:21,180 --> 03:05:23,640
So, actually, the earlier...

3168
03:05:23,640 --> 03:05:25,840
My God, how much HP does this frog have?

3169
03:05:27,080 --> 03:05:27,480
Damn!

3170
03:05:29,220 --> 03:05:33,760
So, anyway, every point of damage you take in the very early area is actually a big deal.

3171
03:05:35,660 --> 03:05:36,620
More so than the late.

3172
03:05:38,180 --> 03:05:41,140
I don't know if I should take this or save it if I find one of those perks.

3173
03:05:45,280 --> 03:05:46,100
I think... no.

3174
03:05:46,880 --> 03:05:47,800
I think we should take it.

3175
03:05:49,520 --> 03:05:51,240
I think I've changed my mind on that.

3176
03:05:53,020 --> 03:05:53,960
We should take those.

3177
03:05:56,520 --> 03:06:00,620
There's... there is such a thing as too optimal, you know?

3178
03:06:01,300 --> 03:06:05,100
Everyone is optimal until they get a fist in their face and the run ends.

3179
03:06:07,820 --> 03:06:08,440
Damn it.

3180
03:06:08,820 --> 03:06:09,260
I got hit.

3181
03:06:11,060 --> 03:06:11,300
Frogs!

3182
03:06:12,360 --> 03:06:13,220
I think I'm dead!

3183
03:06:17,680 --> 03:06:18,920
Well, there it is.

3184
03:06:20,620 --> 03:06:21,340
There it is!

3185
03:06:21,580 --> 03:06:22,540
Fucking frogs and fire!

3186
03:06:23,140 --> 03:06:23,620
Frogs and fire.

3187
03:06:23,700 --> 03:06:25,800
Those are the two hardest enemies in this game.

3188
03:06:27,480 --> 03:06:28,900
I'm actually gonna quit here.

3189
03:06:30,060 --> 03:06:33,560
I'm just gonna... I'm just gonna save the next run for next time.

3190
03:06:38,960 --> 03:06:39,580
What's up, people?

3191
03:06:47,620 --> 03:06:48,540
I have a bit of time.

3192
03:06:52,690 --> 03:06:54,730
By the way, I don't think I should be too scared of spoilers anymore.

3193
03:06:55,310 --> 03:06:57,010
I mean, I already completed the game, right?

3194
03:06:58,970 --> 03:07:02,750
And I guess there's still stuff to be found, but if anything, it's gonna be so obscure.

3195
03:07:03,050 --> 03:07:06,050
People are gonna... I mean, still, don't spoil, of course.

3196
03:07:06,150 --> 03:07:06,730
I'm just saying that.

3197
03:07:06,730 --> 03:07:10,170
What I'm saying is, maybe I shouldn't wait like 30 seconds until I read the chat.

3198
03:07:11,350 --> 03:07:12,090
Anyway, I'm gonna read now.

3199
03:07:16,850 --> 03:07:17,690
Loved your 1 HP run?

3200
03:07:18,930 --> 03:07:19,310
Yeah.

3201
03:07:20,110 --> 03:07:21,830
I can't believe I survived with 1 HP.

3202
03:07:23,030 --> 03:07:24,510
That was actually insanely lucky.

3203
03:07:28,550 --> 03:07:29,950
Do you take notes like a checklist?

3204
03:07:30,350 --> 03:07:30,490
Yes.

3205
03:07:32,350 --> 03:07:33,090
Yep, I do.

3206
03:07:33,290 --> 03:07:33,570
I do.

3207
03:07:33,690 --> 03:07:34,570
I have a notebook right here.

3208
03:07:37,110 --> 03:07:39,810
I'm also gonna write down the stuff that I said today.

3209
03:07:39,810 --> 03:07:43,050
I'm gonna explore the ancient laboratory and all that.

3210
03:07:44,830 --> 03:07:46,130
And I want to go on those platforms.

3211
03:07:47,350 --> 03:07:48,550
There are many things I need to do.

3212
03:07:54,300 --> 03:07:54,940
You don't need spoilers.

3213
03:07:55,180 --> 03:07:55,720
You need experiments.

3214
03:07:56,520 --> 03:07:56,880
Exactly, Lavy.

3215
03:07:58,660 --> 03:07:59,820
That was a crazy run, man.

3216
03:08:00,200 --> 03:08:02,500
And it was the run right after I beat the game, too.

3217
03:08:03,440 --> 03:08:06,100
Like, just straight up back into it, getting a sick run.

3218
03:08:09,030 --> 03:08:10,310
1 HP is all you need.

3219
03:08:10,450 --> 03:08:11,230
I mean, you're right.

3220
03:08:11,490 --> 03:08:12,350
If you play perfectly.

3221
03:08:16,320 --> 03:08:17,980
I did rock those enemies, man.

3222
03:08:20,300 --> 03:08:23,920
I liked the part where you were playing space invaders against falling debris.

3223
03:08:25,040 --> 03:08:26,440
That's actually so true.

3224
03:08:28,960 --> 03:08:32,060
I wonder if anyone's ever done that before, the way I did that, you know?

3225
03:08:32,880 --> 03:08:35,160
There's probably way better ways of doing this, but...

3226
03:08:36,060 --> 03:08:38,160
I used what I had at my disposal, you know?

3227
03:08:40,800 --> 03:08:42,140
People do no hit runs.

3228
03:08:44,240 --> 03:08:45,580
Of course they do.

3229
03:08:46,340 --> 03:08:47,660
That doesn't surprise me at all.

3230
03:08:48,620 --> 03:08:49,420
People are crazy.

3231
03:08:53,170 --> 03:08:55,690
I wonder how many tries that takes on average before you beat the game.

3232
03:08:59,120 --> 03:09:04,480
By the way, when you're capturing your death gif, you can change how much is included by clicking on the frames at the top.

3233
03:09:06,320 --> 03:09:06,740
Oh, yeah.

3234
03:09:07,200 --> 03:09:07,680
Yeah, yeah.

3235
03:09:08,160 --> 03:09:08,820
I know that.

3236
03:09:09,200 --> 03:09:13,060
The thing I would wish, though, is that it only records slightly before my death and after.

3237
03:09:13,060 --> 03:09:19,480
Because if I wait too long and I look at the statistics and then I click save death replay, it doesn't even save my death.

3238
03:09:20,960 --> 03:09:23,240
I feel like that... isn't that like a crazy oversight?

3239
03:09:24,180 --> 03:09:26,140
How is that not an obvious change to make?

3240
03:09:27,060 --> 03:09:28,540
I don't understand that.

3241
03:09:30,720 --> 03:09:33,920
When would you ever want to save the part after you died?

3242
03:09:34,320 --> 03:09:34,480
Ever?

3243
03:09:35,800 --> 03:09:36,180
You know?

3244
03:09:39,460 --> 03:09:42,000
I have gone into this game without looking anything up.

3245
03:09:42,000 --> 03:09:45,180
I'm over 300 attempts with no wins for whatever that's worth.

3246
03:09:45,720 --> 03:09:47,040
I mean, are you having fun with it?

3247
03:09:47,220 --> 03:09:48,100
That's the only question.

3248
03:09:49,180 --> 03:09:54,640
If you're having fun with it, and I guess you are, otherwise you wouldn't have done 300 attempts, then everything's fine.

3249
03:09:55,000 --> 03:09:55,880
Then don't worry about it.

3250
03:09:57,640 --> 03:09:59,600
Honestly, I don't even care that I got a win.

3251
03:10:00,240 --> 03:10:02,520
The funniest part is just playing this game, man.

3252
03:10:06,710 --> 03:10:08,090
So I think that's cool.

3253
03:10:08,950 --> 03:10:10,050
Seems like you're enjoying it.

3254
03:10:11,610 --> 03:10:12,290
Deeply disturbed.

3255
03:10:12,550 --> 03:10:12,950
I love your name.

3256
03:10:12,950 --> 03:10:14,810
I'm loving every one of my failures.

3257
03:10:15,330 --> 03:10:16,110
That's the spirit.

3258
03:10:18,290 --> 03:10:19,090
Good man.

3259
03:10:23,830 --> 03:10:26,610
There's a keybind to watch replays even when you aren't dead.

3260
03:10:26,850 --> 03:10:27,050
Oh!

3261
03:10:28,030 --> 03:10:28,430
Really?

3262
03:10:29,810 --> 03:10:31,930
Okay, that's actually good knowledge there.

3263
03:10:32,130 --> 03:10:32,750
What is the keybind?

3264
03:10:33,690 --> 03:10:34,590
I would love to know that.

3265
03:10:35,250 --> 03:10:38,550
Because sometimes some things happen and you're like, what the fuck just happened?

3266
03:10:39,190 --> 03:10:41,430
And you would love to see that in like instant replay.

3267
03:10:48,710 --> 03:10:49,050
Light night.

3268
03:10:49,050 --> 03:10:53,210
You can change in the setting how long the recording is and even enable the recording when you're not dead.

3269
03:10:53,310 --> 03:10:53,770
Okay, yeah.

3270
03:10:54,350 --> 03:10:56,030
I know that I can change it to...

3271
03:10:57,030 --> 03:10:58,930
so that it saves a longer GIF.

3272
03:10:59,530 --> 03:11:00,610
I already did that actually.

3273
03:11:00,810 --> 03:11:02,270
I increased the megabytes that it saves.

3274
03:11:03,170 --> 03:11:06,230
But I did not know that I could save anything at any time.

3275
03:11:06,810 --> 03:11:07,070
F11.

3276
03:11:07,370 --> 03:11:08,010
Okay, thanks.

3277
03:11:08,970 --> 03:11:09,250
Awesome.

3278
03:11:10,350 --> 03:11:11,710
I'm gonna remember that.

3279
03:11:14,680 --> 03:11:15,460
Liminal Roar.

3280
03:11:16,800 --> 03:11:19,920
I played mostly blind and took 200 hours for my first win.

3281
03:11:20,420 --> 03:11:23,240
But I loved every hour and it was like over 400 deaths.

3282
03:11:23,540 --> 03:11:23,660
Damn.

3283
03:11:24,540 --> 03:11:26,060
You must have loved a lot of that, yeah.

3284
03:11:29,480 --> 03:11:30,320
But here's the thing.

3285
03:11:31,080 --> 03:11:33,860
People are a little bit different in the way they approach games, right?

3286
03:11:34,080 --> 03:11:38,780
I assume some people would just not play very safe at all and just sort of...

3287
03:11:40,040 --> 03:11:41,600
just go crazy, you know?

3288
03:11:41,680 --> 03:11:45,700
Just jump in, shoot everything without a care in the world and hope for some good spells.

3289
03:11:45,860 --> 03:11:47,500
That's a way to do it and that's fun, I guess.

3290
03:11:48,540 --> 03:11:50,200
And then there's people that do it a little slower.

3291
03:11:50,680 --> 03:11:55,540
So naturally those people are gonna have less deaths, you know?

3292
03:11:57,880 --> 03:12:00,120
But as long as they're having fun, that's all that matters.

3293
03:12:01,300 --> 03:12:02,400
Fuck it, we ball play style?

3294
03:12:02,560 --> 03:12:03,740
