Might not fit to do a playthrough because of that.

3547
03:26:12,420 --> 03:26:12,720
Oh, really?

3548
03:26:15,180 --> 03:26:16,940
I mean, I like gameplay focused games.

3549
03:26:17,120 --> 03:26:17,480
That's fine.

3550
03:26:19,360 --> 03:26:21,660
I mean, that's purely what Noita is, right?

3551
03:26:21,840 --> 03:26:25,020
I mean, there is a bit of lore that I found so far.

3552
03:26:25,080 --> 03:26:26,800
And I definitely want to explore more of the lore.

3553
03:26:27,640 --> 03:26:29,080
But so far, it's mostly gameplay.

3554
03:26:29,300 --> 03:26:31,080
But oh boy, is the gameplay good.

3555
03:26:32,100 --> 03:26:34,520
The gameplay of Noita is unbelievably good.

3556
03:26:36,740 --> 03:26:38,180
I might know a lot about it.

3557
03:26:38,440 --> 03:26:41,280
I'm working on a run that is over 150 hours long.

3558
03:26:43,380 --> 03:26:44,660
Alchemy is my main thing.

3559
03:26:44,940 --> 03:26:45,100
What?

3560
03:26:46,720 --> 03:26:47,600
150 hours?

3561
03:26:49,440 --> 03:26:51,020
Oh man, that's crazy.

3562
03:26:54,370 --> 03:26:56,550
That just made me even more hyped about the game.

3563
03:26:57,030 --> 03:26:57,590
I'm not gonna lie.

3564
03:26:58,250 --> 03:26:59,310
The fact that you can do that...

3565
03:27:00,550 --> 03:27:03,690
A 150 hour run means there's gotta be an insane amount of content.

3566
03:27:04,790 --> 03:27:05,990
You just excited me.

3567
03:27:07,410 --> 03:27:08,770
But what's to come?

3568
03:27:13,160 --> 03:27:14,440
How far do I record in advance?

3569
03:27:14,980 --> 03:27:18,420
Usually, it depends how busy I am in real life.

3570
03:27:18,900 --> 03:27:21,020
But usually between three and ten episodes ahead.

3571
03:27:26,120 --> 03:27:27,280
Noita is one of the greatest games...

3572
03:27:27,280 --> 03:27:30,520
Dude, so far it's just pure fun.

3573
03:27:32,540 --> 03:27:37,900
I've already had so many moments where I thought, holy shit, I've never experienced that in a video game before.

3574
03:27:39,300 --> 03:27:40,220
Like, here's an example.

3575
03:27:40,760 --> 03:27:43,500
The other day, I was in the Heezy base.

3576
03:27:44,860 --> 03:27:46,280
And I was just shooting my wand, you know?

3577
03:27:46,380 --> 03:27:47,200
Be like, what's over there?

3578
03:27:47,320 --> 03:27:48,140
And I hit something.

3579
03:27:49,040 --> 03:27:57,500
And then out of fucking nowhere, one of those propane tanks came flying towards me because it was leaking and Newton's Third Law and all that, right?

3580
03:27:57,780 --> 03:27:59,080
And it just flew around me.

3581
03:27:59,520 --> 03:28:03,120
And I got so fucking scared because I didn't know what was gonna happen there.

3582
03:28:03,480 --> 03:28:04,600
I only knew that they hurt.

3583
03:28:05,580 --> 03:28:07,720
And it felt like it was following me.

3584
03:28:08,240 --> 03:28:10,880
And that just seemed like such a random ass encounter.

3585
03:28:11,480 --> 03:28:13,640
But it was so cool, you know?

3586
03:28:13,740 --> 03:28:15,500
And I can list a million of those situations.

3587
03:28:17,260 --> 03:28:19,020
I lost my shit in that moment.

3588
03:28:20,120 --> 03:28:21,440
Just the fact that that is possible.

3589
03:28:21,640 --> 03:28:22,480
Here's another thing.

3590
03:28:23,600 --> 03:28:25,580
I was playing around with glowing lance.

3591
03:28:26,600 --> 03:28:28,200
And I had a speed up on it.

3592
03:28:28,880 --> 03:28:31,640
And I realized that it could cut through material.

3593
03:28:32,660 --> 03:28:35,240
And I had trouble because I couldn't dig through things, right?

3594
03:28:35,940 --> 03:28:38,040
And for the longest time, I didn't know what to do.

3595
03:28:38,240 --> 03:28:40,900
So I started hitting people through walls and shit.

3596
03:28:40,940 --> 03:28:42,040
And that was so fun.

3597
03:28:42,960 --> 03:28:49,980
And then I realized, holy shit, I can make a small hole with my glowing lance and teleport through it with my teleport wand.

3598
03:28:50,600 --> 03:28:53,500
When I realized that, I felt so fucking smart.

3599
03:28:54,200 --> 03:28:55,480
God damn, that was cool.

3600
03:28:56,960 --> 03:28:58,360
One of the best things ever.

3601
03:29:02,210 --> 03:29:10,230
And just today, I don't know if you saw that part, but I was trying to dig up again through the holy mountains and backtrack.

3602
03:29:10,910 --> 03:29:13,630
But I didn't really have a digging wand, but I did have an earthquake thing.

3603
03:29:14,410 --> 03:29:17,750
So I would earthquake everything and then dig away the falling debris.

3604
03:29:18,450 --> 03:29:20,090
Pretty much playing Space Invaders.

3605
03:29:22,730 --> 03:29:24,470
The fact that you could just do that shit.

3606
03:29:24,710 --> 03:29:29,410
And I get the feeling sometimes that, man, I'm not sure anyone else has done this.

3607
03:29:30,070 --> 03:29:31,570
You know, but probably they have.

3608
03:29:31,690 --> 03:29:33,310
It's an old game by now, I guess.

3609
03:29:33,990 --> 03:29:35,390
So maybe I'm not the first to try that.

3610
03:29:35,490 --> 03:29:40,190
But just the feeling you get of, man, this may actually be something novel, you know?

3611
03:29:41,290 --> 03:29:41,750
Feels amazing.

3612
03:29:42,490 --> 03:29:42,870
Yeah.

3613
03:29:48,320 --> 03:29:51,820
Oh yeah, the first time I fired a homing rock in the holy mountain.

3614
03:29:53,380 --> 03:29:54,940
I got so fucking scared.

3615
03:29:58,100 --> 03:30:02,740
It's the same kind of energy as that wild propane tank just flying about, you know?

3616
03:30:02,880 --> 03:30:07,400
It's the chaos of it and the fear that it may hit you in the face.

3617
03:30:08,120 --> 03:30:09,400
And it just looks so violent.

3618
03:30:16,130 --> 03:30:17,230
It was so cool.

3619
03:30:17,750 --> 03:30:23,110
Hey Raiko, there's a ton of stuff in this game that is probably impossible to discover without the wiki.

3620
03:30:23,570 --> 03:30:24,470
What do you want to do about that?

3621
03:30:25,070 --> 03:30:25,270
Nothing.

3622
03:30:26,310 --> 03:30:28,890
I'm prepared to not know everything about this game and that's fine.

3623
03:30:31,940 --> 03:30:35,900
I'm gonna stop playing this game when I don't have fun with it anymore or I get tired of it.

3624
03:30:36,500 --> 03:30:37,960
Sometimes you just need breaks from games.

3625
03:30:38,800 --> 03:30:40,700
But I'm okay with never finding all the secrets.

3626
03:30:40,860 --> 03:30:42,000
That's totally okay with me.

3627
03:30:42,600 --> 03:30:47,760
I will find as much as I can on my own, have fun with it as long as I can and then I'll play something else.

3628
03:30:49,380 --> 03:30:53,420
And maybe in the future when I get that itch again because man, the neuter itch is real.

3629
03:31:02,620 --> 03:31:05,340
That first homing rock was even better than your last one.

3630
03:31:05,560 --> 03:31:07,460
It had accelerated homing, did it?

3631
03:31:09,320 --> 03:31:09,800
Damn.

3632
03:31:10,860 --> 03:31:12,340
I'm so sad I didn't use it.

3633
03:31:13,360 --> 03:31:15,580
I was too afraid it would hit me in the face.

3634
03:31:15,960 --> 03:31:18,500
I mean, it's not a bad thing to assume, right?

3635
03:31:19,240 --> 03:31:20,960
Falling debris usually hurts you.

3636
03:31:25,780 --> 03:31:29,660
You have 1500 hours and you still occasionally learn new tricks.

3637
03:31:29,660 --> 03:31:30,380
That's wild.

3638
03:31:32,620 --> 03:31:33,300
How many wins do you have?

3639
03:31:33,820 --> 03:31:34,360
I'm just curious.

3640
03:31:34,920 --> 03:31:36,260
Not that it's a competition or anything.

3641
03:31:38,880 --> 03:31:42,280
Are you going for a lot of wins or are you going for just exploring the world?

3642
03:31:50,470 --> 03:31:51,230
Addy is Maddie.

3643
03:31:51,730 --> 03:31:54,350
Hey, started playing neuter but feel I'm getting killed immediately.

3644
03:31:54,950 --> 03:31:55,950
I know that feeling, man.

3645
03:31:56,770 --> 03:31:57,330
It happens.

3646
03:31:58,330 --> 03:32:00,070
My best advice is to just go slowly.

3647
03:32:01,070 --> 03:32:03,170
Just go slowly, one enemy at a time.

3648
03:32:03,510 --> 03:32:04,590
Try to understand what's happening.

3649
03:32:04,750 --> 03:32:05,590
