But I also died a lot.

3652
03:32:10,430 --> 03:32:11,770
Just have fun with it.

3653
03:32:15,670 --> 03:32:16,910
I started playing when Oliver started.

3654
03:32:17,150 --> 03:32:19,090
Today I discovered something about Luminous Drills.

3655
03:32:19,490 --> 03:32:20,670
That's awesome, I lied.

3656
03:32:21,450 --> 03:32:24,430
I'm actually so happy that other people are trying the games that I'm playing.

3657
03:32:26,490 --> 03:32:28,570
