3658
03:32:29,090 --> 03:32:34,510
And I see so many comments saying that they also started playing it because it looked cool and they didn't know about it.

3659
03:32:35,550 --> 03:32:36,910
That's the coolest feeling, you know?

3660
03:32:36,910 --> 03:32:39,090
We're all experiencing the games together, sort of.

3661
03:32:39,590 --> 03:32:40,950
At least those that start with me.

3662
03:32:48,210 --> 03:32:49,710
Getting noiset is inevitable.

3663
03:32:51,770 --> 03:32:52,210
Noiset.

3664
03:32:52,570 --> 03:32:53,070
I love that.

3665
